OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters rescue horse stuck in
OL,4,Amud in ditch
OL,5,
OL,6,FOwner Carly Wilford, 36, from Bingham,
OL,7,Fsaid: "They were amazing with us and
OL,8,FArna, we know it's an extremely tough
OL,9,Ftime for [firefighters] at the moment."
